      "content": "Exactly. If the empirical evidence from actual countries shows they fail to raise revenue and just punish investment, then it feels less like a \"debate\" and more like a settled fact that they are bad policy. Why do economists keep pushing the inequality angle if the economic data so clearly points to the downsides?",
